usage: query_activities.py [-h] --profile PROFILE --output OUTPUT
                           [--large-capture] [--allow-unmapped-event-labels]

Bounded all-kind activity elapsed accounting for decoded measureme records.
Retains compact interval tuples per Rust thread, not constant-memory
streaming. No activity classification, CPU-work estimate, or execution-DAG
span inference.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --profile PROFILE
  --output OUTPUT
  --large-capture
  --allow-unmapped-event-labels
